     fhir:div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ahip-background-white-category</b></p><a name=\"ahip-background-white-category\"> </a><a name=\"hcahip-background-white-category\"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-CDCREC.html\"><code>urn:oid:2.16.840.1.113883.6.238</code></a><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td>2110-5</td><td>English</td></tr><tr><td>2111-3</td><td>French</td></tr><tr><td>2112-1</td><td>German</td></tr><tr><td>2113-9</td><td>Irish</td></tr><tr><td>2114-7</td><td>Italian</td></tr><tr><td>2115-4</td><td>Polish</td></tr><tr><td>2116-2</td><td>Scottish</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <code>http://ahip.org/demographics/ImplementationGuide/ahip.demo/CodeSystem/ahip-demo-additional-background-codes</code><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td>9999-19</td><td>Saudi</td></tr><tr><td>9999-20</td><td>Danish</td></tr><tr><td>9999-21</td><td>Dutch</td></tr><tr><td>9999-22</td><td>Greek</td></tr><tr><td>9999-23</td><td>Jewish: Ashkenazi</td></tr><tr><td>9999-24</td><td>Jewish: Sephardic</td></tr><tr><td>9999-25</td><td>Lithuanian</td></tr><tr><td>9999-26</td><td>Norwegian</td></tr><tr><td>9999-27</td><td>Portuguese</td></tr><tr><td>9999-28</td><td>Russian</td></tr><tr><td>9999-29</td><td>Swedish</td></tr><tr><td>9999-30</td><td>Ukrainian</td></tr><tr><td>9999-31</td><td>Welsh</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-NullFlavor.html\"><code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-NullFlavor</code></a><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-NullFlavor.html#v3-NullFlavor-ASKU\">ASKU</a></td><td>I don't know</td><td>Information was sought but not found (e.g., patient was asked but didn't know)</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <code>http://ahip.org/demographics/ImplementationGuide/ahip.demo/CodeSystem/AHIPDemoAdditionalNullFlavor</code><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td>CNTR</td><td>I choose not to respond at this time</td></tr><tr><td>PSIN</td><td>Please specify if not listed above</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral
